# QuickActionCard Component

A reusable clickable card used for primary quick-action navigation across dashboard views.

## Location
- Component: `src/components/QuickActionCard.jsx`
- Styles: `src/components/QuickActionCard.scss`
- Story: `src/stories/QuickActionCard.stories.jsx`

## Usage


import QuickActionCard from '../components/QuickActionCard';
import { DocumentBlank } from '@carbon/icons-react';

<QuickActionCard
  icon={DocumentBlank}
  title="View Policies"
  description="Manage your active insurance policies"
  href="/policies"
/>
```

## Props

| Prop | Type | Required | Description |
|------|------|----------|-------------|
| `icon` | Carbon icon component | No | Icon displayed in the red brand container |
| `title` | string | Yes | Primary label for the action |
| `description` | string | Yes | Short supporting text beneath the title |
| `href` | string | No | Navigation URL (uses Carbon ClickableTile href) |
| `onClick` | function | No | Click handler for programmatic navigation |

## Design Specifications

- **Background**: `var(--background-secondary)` — adapts to light/dark themes
- **Border**: `1px solid var(--border-subtle)`
- **Icon container**: 56×56px, `var(--interactive-primary)` (brand red), `var(--radius-md)` border-radius
- **Icon color**: `var(--text-on-color)` (white) — always readable on the red background
- **Title**: `var(--body-lg-size)`, `var(--font-weight-semibold)`, `var(--text-primary)`
- **Description**: `var(--body-sm-size)`, `var(--text-secondary)`
- **Hover**: red border glow, slight lift (`translateY(-2px)`), arrow nudge (`translateX(4px)`)

## Theme Compatibility

Fully theme-aware — tested and working in:
- ✅ Light mode (`white` theme)
- ✅ Dark mode (`g100` theme)

All colors use semantic CSS variables, no hardcoded values.

## Where It's Used

- `src/pages/DashboardHome.jsx` — View Policies, File a Claim, Make a Payment
- `src/pages/business/BusinessDashboard.jsx` — Properties, Fleet, Map, File Claim, Make Payment

